  <NAME>Homo sapiens</NAME>
  <TITLE>Expression profiling of sorted human Thymocyte populations</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>Thymus samples were obtained as surgical tissue discards from 3 pediatric patients (age from 7 days to 6 months) undergoing cardiac surgery at the New York Presbyterian Hospital. RNA was excracted and processed for expression analysis from 7 isolated T-Cell populations. Overall design: Gene expression analysis of 7 T-Cell populations isolated from surgical samples of 3 human thymi</DESCRIPTION>
